  :source/note
  "26 sources, all machine-checkable, and the verifier checks all 26 or refuses
   to report a pass. What this register does NOT cover, so that its absence is
   not read as a measured zero: no per-tender notice (jica.tender-notices is
   the list, not the notices); no treaty text for the WTO Government
   Procurement Agreement, only Japan's implementing order; no ODA country
   assistance policies; no article-level text from any statute -- every law
   entry here is verified at the level of identity, not content. A claim that
   needs an article needs a human to read it."}
